{"title":"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following numbers is largest?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/5/c3531b6c59d23b94e5a6b6bf03f3b8f5de5a3ea1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 9.12344 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 9.123\\overline{4} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 9.12\\overline{34} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 9.1\\overline{234} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 9.\\overline{1234}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"547\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first six decimal places of the answer choices are as follows: \n</p>\n<ul><li>(A): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/a/d8ad718436fe6af819bde9c7da770d98f57f8450.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9.123440$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" /></li></ul>\n<ul><li>(B): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/5/fa5207858688cb2a855c9bb8a42e7243f3d320c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9.123444$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" /></li></ul>\n<ul><li>(C): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/0/bd0d14c8b2b4bbfce09224078e006235e202adb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9.123434$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" /></li></ul>\n<ul><li>(D): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/1/8616969bed7eca6f8df1dd4bc292a505226168cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9.123423$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" /></li></ul>\n<ul><li>(E): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/e/68e492f71155231af7b6cd4edc9bd36fbe2de40a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9.123412$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" /></li></ul>\n<p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/8/0c8107188c6356e139df5a250639c1adde44ad95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 9.123\\overline{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"98\" height=\"33\" /> is the largest of these numbers.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Looking at the fifth digit after the decimal of each, we find that choices <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are eliminated.\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> has a non-zero sixth digit after the decimal, unlike <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, we conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" /> is the largest number.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME\" title=\"1998 AJHSME\">1998 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=199